<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Parlex started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Parlex started as buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advest Inc said Tuesday it started coverage of Parlex Corp with a buy rating and a price target of $22 per share.</p>
<p>-- Analyst David Parrish said in a research note that Parlex had numerous patented technologies that enabled it to provide some of the most cost-effective interconnect solutions in the industry.</p>
<p>-- Parrish projected a 25 percent long-term growth rate for Parlex.</p>
<p>-- The stock added 1-1/4 to 18-1/2.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk))</p>
